      47.76,
      479.8,
      288.93,
      612.01
    ],
    "text": "It is hereby notified that any person having a claim to the owner-ship or possession or interest to one or more of the parcels of lands reflected in the Cadastral Map No. 620114 made by the Surveyor-General under Section 11 of the Registration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998 relating to the village of Kanihammulla (Block 01) or any part thereof, situated within the Grama Nilad-hari Division of 258D - Watawala in the Divisional Secretariat Division of Balangoda in the District of Ratnapura in the Province of Sabaragamuwa should submit his claim to the undersigned before 17th April, 2019 In the event of failure to submit any claim before the above-mentioned date, action will be taken to hold an exparte inquiry to determine title to the land and accordingly pub-",
